Type: Package
Package: jsurvival
Title: Survival Module of 'ClinicoPath' for 'jamovi'
Version: 1.1.3
Date: 2026-10-30
Authors@R: person(given = "Serdar", family = "Balci", role = c("aut",
 "cre", "cph"), email = "serdarbalci@serdarbalci.com", comment =
 c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7852-3851"))
Maintainer: Serdar Balci <serdarbalci@serdarbalci.com>
Description: Time-to-event analysis for clinicopathological research in 'jamovi':
 Kaplan-Meier estimates, log-rank tests, Cox regression, competing-risk cumulative
 incidence, cut-off analysis of continuous markers, multivariable and LASSO
 Cox models, odds ratios, and preparation of dates and outcomes for survival
 analysis. Part of the ClinicoPath suite. For comments, suggestions, feature
 requests or reporting bugs, please open an issue at
 <https://github.com/sbalci/ClinicoPathJamoviModule/issues/>.
